        "id": "gate_status_comment",
        "type": "comment",
        "z": "gate_main_tab",
        "name": "═══════════════ POWER STATUS & SMS ALERTS ═══════════════",
        "info": "## Main Gate Status\n\nMonitors and displays all gate controller status:\n- Power status (battery/mains)\n- Relay 1-4 states (Relay 3 = main gate actuator per [PlatformIO_ESP8266_Main_Entry](https://github.com/tinel-c/PlatformIO_ESP8266_Main_Entry))\n- Mains power availability\n- Keypad connectivity\n- Timestamp of last update\n\n### MQTT Topics:\n- MainGate/STAT/eventPower\n- MainGate/STAT/reccurentStatusRelay1-4\n- MainGate/STAT/reccurentStatusMains\n- MainGate/STAT/reccurentStatusKeypad\n\n### SMS Alerts:\nSends SMS notification on power status changes.",
        "x": 370,
        "y": 380,
        "wires": []
    },
